				<h2 class="feature-benefit__title contrast-target" data-font-size-mo="30" data-font-size-pc="48">Power up your notetaking with S Pen
				</h2>
				<div class="feature-benefit__desc-wrap">
					
					<p class="feature-benefit__desc contrast-target" data-font-size-mo="12" data-font-size-pc="18">Write, sketch, draw on your favorite notetaking app with the redesigned water and dust-resistant inbox S Pen. Now in four trendy colors, it attaches magnetically to the back of your device and matches its style. Galaxy Tab S9 FE and Tab S9 FE+ even support S Pen Creator Edition to unleash your full creative potential.
					</p>
					
					
				</div>
			</div>
