				</h2>
				<div class="feature-benefit__desc-wrap">
					
					<p class="feature-benefit__desc contrast-target" data-font-size-mo="12" data-font-size-pc="18">Stay connected on the go and swap networks easily with Dual SIM on the Galaxy Tab S9 FE and Tab S9 FE+. Activate your eSIM and set it up as primary with just a few taps. When switching devices, your eSIM contacts move, too, so no friends get left behind.
					</p>
					
					
				</div>
